{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01TRYkaBAjuVSufkcVAqMApw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Project State Summary\n\n**Problem:** go-unix-utils stress-tests a spec-driven code generation pipeline using GNU coreutils/moreutils as the subject. PRDs derived from C source feed a Claude-based orchestrator that generates Go implementations, verified by differential testing against Homebrew GNU binaries.\n\n**Architecture:** Human writes PRDs → orchestrator generates Go in `cmd/` → `pkg/testutils` runs differential tests against GNU reference binaries. Shared libraries: `pkg/sys` (syscalls), `pkg/format` (formatting), `pkg/testutils` (diff harness).\n\n**Current state:** Releases 00.0 through 02.2 are implemented (code at v1 tags). Release 05.0 is the current generation target. Two of four 05.0 use cases are already done per recent commits: echo (task 346) and tac (task 347). Remaining: **nl** (rel05.0-uc003) and **fold** (rel05.0-uc004).\n\n**Priority:** nl comes before fold in canonical ordering (alphabetical path tiebreak). With the 1-task limit, I propose nl.\n\n```yaml\n- index: 0\n  title: \"cmd/nl: implement nl utility (prd-nl R1-R4)\"\n  dependency: -1\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/product-requirements/prd-nl.yaml (all requirements and acceptance criteria)\n      - docs/specs/use-cases/rel05.0-uc003-nl.yaml (end-to-end execution path)\n      - docs/specs/test-suites/test-rel-05.0.yaml (test cases for nl)\n      - docs/ARCHITECTURE.yaml (shared_protocols section -- differential testing pattern and SIGPIPE handling)\n      - cmd/tac/main.go (reference for cmd/ structure and conventions in this project)\n      - cmd/tac/tac_test.go (reference for differential test file structure)\n      - pkg/testutils/difftest.go (DiffTest struct and RunDiffTests API)\n      - pkg/sys/sigpipe.go (InstallSIGPIPEHandler API)\n\n    files:\n      - path: cmd/nl/main.go\n        action: create\n        note: nl utility implementation\n      - path: cmd/nl/nl_test.go\n        action: create\n        note: differential tests against gnl reference binary\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: \"Implement the nl command per prd-nl R1: read from stdin or named files and write numbered lines to stdout\"\n      - id: R2\n        text: \"Implement all flags per prd-nl R2: numbering style (-b), format (-n), separator (-s), width (-w), starting number (-v), increment (-i), and header/body/footer section delimiters\"\n      - id: R3\n        text: \"Implement logical page sections per prd-nl R3: recognize header (\\\\:\\\\:\\\\:), body (\\\\:\\\\:), and footer (\\\\:) section delimiters, applying per-section numbering styles (-h, -b, -f flags)\"\n      - id: R4\n        text: \"Implement differential tests per prd-nl R4: build the Go binary with testutils.BuildBinary, locate gnl via exec.LookPath (t.Skip if absent), define DiffTest cases covering all flags and section delimiter behavior, run via testutils.RunDiffTests\"\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: \"Call sys.InstallSIGPIPEHandler() at the start of main per the shared SIGPIPE protocol in ARCHITECTURE.yaml\"\n      - id: D2\n        text: \"Use pkg/testutils.RunDiffTests for all differential tests. Reference binary is gnl (Homebrew coreutils). Skip gracefully via exec.LookPath per the shared graceful-skip protocol\"\n      - id: D3\n        text: \"Set LC_ALL=C in all differential test environments per ARCHITECTURE.yaml locale handling decision (DD6)\"\n      - id: D4\n        text: \"Follow the same cmd/ package structure as cmd/tac: main.go for implementation, nl_test.go for differential tests\"\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: \"cmd/nl/main.go compiles with no errors (go build ./cmd/nl/)\"\n      - id: AC2\n        text: \"go vet ./cmd/nl/ reports no issues\"\n      - id: AC3\n        text: \"cmd/nl/nl_test.go runs successfully (go test ./cmd/nl/ -v); tests skip gracefully when gnl is not in PATH\"\n      - id: AC4\n        text: \"All differential test cases pass against gnl when the reference binary is available\"\n      - id: AC5\n        text: \"nl reads from stdin when no file arguments are given and from named files when provided\"\n      - id: AC6\n        text: \"All flags documented in prd-nl are implemented and exercised by at least one test case\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":27546,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":27546},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dbb84e00-7157-40fa-bb88-8e6d7da79209","uuid":"6e3f9f0b-12f5-43c1-9ee5-0f9833cef644"}
