        note: nl utility implementation\n      - path: cmd/nl/nl_test.go\n        action: create\n        note: differential tests against gnl reference binary\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: \"Implement the nl command per prd-nl R1: read from stdin or named files and write numbered lines to stdout\"\n      - id: R2\n        text: \"Implement all flags per prd-nl R2: numbering style (-b), format (-n), separator (-s), width (-w), starting number (-v), increment (-i), and header/body/footer section delimiters\"\n      - id: R3\n        text: \"Implement logical page sections per prd-nl R3: recognize header (\\\\:\\\\:\\\\:), body (\\\\:\\\\:), and footer (\\\\:) section delimiters, applying per-section numbering styles (-h, -b, -f flags)\"\n      - id: R4\n        text: \"Implement differential tests per prd-nl R4: build the Go binary with testutils.BuildBinary, locate gnl via exec.LookPath (t.Skip if absent), define DiffTest cases covering all flags and section delimiter behavior, run via testutils.RunDiffTests\"\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: \"Call sys.InstallSIGPIPEHandler() at the start of main per the shared SIGPIPE protocol in ARCHITECTURE.yaml\"\n      - id: D2\n        text: \"Use pkg/testutils.RunDiffTests for all differential tests. Reference binary is gnl (Homebrew coreutils). Skip gracefully via exec.LookPath per the shared graceful-skip protocol\"\n      - id: D3\n        text: \"Set LC_ALL=C in all differential test environments per ARCHITECTURE.yaml locale handling decision (DD6)\"\n      - id: D4\n        text: \"Follow the same cmd/ package structure as cmd/tac: main.go for implementation, nl_test.go for differential tests\"\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: \"cmd/nl/main.go compiles with no errors (go build ./cmd/nl/)\"\n      - id: AC2\n        text: \"go vet ./cmd/nl/ reports no issues\"\n      - id: AC3\n        text: \"cmd/nl/nl_test.go runs successfully (go test ./cmd/nl/ -v